<title>PHILIPPINES: Piltel 9-mth net up 27 pct.</title>
<headline>Piltel 9-mth net up 27 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Revenues (billion)	    3.685 vs 2.73</p>
<p>    Net income			722.4 vs 568.2</p>
<p>Note: Full name Pilipino Telephone Corp, the cellular phone unit of Philippine Long Distance Telephone Co.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
